
== [1] A. Client-Facing API rejects missing or invalid credentials ==
$ GET http://localhost:8080/v1/hazards?hazard_type=SEISMIC&limit=20 (no Authorization)
   PASS no header -> 401
$ GET with empty Bearer
   PASS empty Bearer -> 401
   PASS garbage JWT -> 403

== [2] B. Media receives Ringkasan only (enforced on the server) ==
   PASS media list omits all Mentah fields on first item

== [3] C. Media cannot request Mentah explicitly ==
   PASS media ?fields=latitude -> 403
   PASS media ?include=mentah -> 403
   PASS media ?fields=Latitude -> 403
   PASS media ?fields=hazard_id,attributes -> 403
   PASS media ?fields%5B%5D=longitude -> 403
   PASS media ?fields=source_ref_id -> 403
   PASS media ?include=MENTAH -> 403
   PASS media ?include=mentah,summary -> 403
   PASS media ?include=raw -> 403
   PASS media ?include=all -> 403
   PASS media asking only for Ringkasan fields -> 200

== [4] D. Media denied /v1/sources/status; Lapangan allowed ==
   PASS media /v1/sources/status -> 403
   PASS lapangan /v1/sources/status -> 200

== [5] E. Lapangan and Pusat receive Mentah on the same list ==
   PASS lapangan list includes Mentah-capable payload
   PASS pusat list includes Mentah-capable payload

== [6] F. Access token TTL: expired access rejected; refresh without new client login ==
   expires_in=60s (configured AUTH_ACCESS_TTL_SEC=60)
   PASS fresh access token works
   sleeping 57s until JWT exp (+2s skew)...
   PASS expired access token -> 403
$ POST http://localhost:8084/v1/refresh
   PASS refreshed access works without client_id/secret again
   PASS rotated refresh token cannot be reused (403)

== [7] G. Auth service rejects wrong client secret (403) ==
$ POST /v1/token wrong secret
   PASS wrong client_secret -> 403
   PASS P3 client auth and field policy demo complete
